<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMP Inc cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMP Inc cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it cut AMP Inc's rating to near-term neutral from accumulate and kept the company at long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed on Wednesday at 38-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730.</p>
</text>
